:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Lurkers Lot []
<<effects>><<childSelect $BirdTower.hunt.leader>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You and <<babyhawks>> surround the lurkers. <<childname>>
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你和<<babyhawks>>包围了潜伏者，<<childname>>
<</language>>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').leaderTrait is "dominant">>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      fixates on one of the lurkers. <<childHe>> has already locked onto a target.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      盯着其中一只潜伏者。<<childHe>>已经锁定目标了。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      looks at you, waiting for you to choose a target.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      看着你，等着你选择目标。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    One is on its own, and a few others are huddled close together.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    有一只落单的，还有几只紧靠在一起。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<set _Single to 600-maplebirch.get('BirdTower').party.length*50>>
<<set _Double to 1200-maplebirch.get('BirdTower').party.length*50>>
<<lanLink ["Hunt the one on its own", "狩猎落单的那只"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Lurkers Lot Single">><</lanLink>><<dancedifficulty 1 _Single>>
<br>
<<lanLink ["Hunt the two huddled together", "狩猎凑在一起的两只"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Lurkers Lot Double">><</lanLink>><<dancedifficulty 300 _Double>>
<br>
<<lanLink ["Hunt the whole group", "狩猎一整群"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Lurkers Lot Group">><</lanLink>><<dancedifficulty 600 1200>><<tendingdifficulty 1 700>>
<br>
:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Lurkers Lot Single []
<<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You fix your eyes on the lone lurker, then glance at your children. You have all decided on your target. You dive down after <<babyhawksthem>>.
    <br><br>
    <<childname>> succeeds in grabbing one with their talons.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你盯着落单的那只潜伏者，再看了看你的孩子。你们都决定好目标了。你跟着<<babyhawksthem>>俯冲而下。
    <br><br>
    <<childname>>成功用爪子抓住了一只。
<</language>>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').party.length gt 1>>
  <<set _hawksIDcopy to $BirdTower.hunt.ids.filter(id => id !== $BirdTower.hunt.leader)>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<childrenNames _hawksIDcopy>> pounce on the lurkers too.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<childrenNames _hawksIDcopy>>也扑向潜伏者。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<set _Single to 600-maplebirch.get('BirdTower').party.length*50>>
<<dancedifficulty 1 _Single true>>
<<if $danceSuccess>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The other lurkers leap away, <span class="green">but you still caught one</span>. You fly back into the air with your spoils.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      其他潜伏者跳着逃开了，<span class="green">但你还是抓到了一只</span>。你带着战利品飞回空中。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<flight_hunt_get "lurkers" 2>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      The other lurkers leap away, and your target <span class="red">dodges your dive</span>; you catch only air. You try to grab another, but they have all fled. You return to the air empty-taloned.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      其他潜伏者跳着逃开了，你的目标<span class="red">躲开了你的俯冲</span>，你只抓到了空气。你试着再去捉另一只，但它们已经全逃了。你空着手回到了空中。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<set _huntFail to 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<childname>> gives a soft chatter, comforting you. At least <<childhim>> did not fail.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<childname>>发出小声的叽喳叫，安慰着你。至少，<<childhim>>并没有失败。
  <</language>>
  <<flight_hunt_get "lurkers" 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<birdtower_hunt_companion_loot>>
<<babyhawk_hunt_return>>

:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Lurkers Lot Double []
<<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Eager to prove your skill, you fix your eyes on the pair of lurkers. To show that you want to strike first, you tilt to the side.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    想证明你的能力，你盯着那对潜伏者。为了表示你想先进攻，你向侧边倾斜。
<</language>>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').leaderTrait is "dominant">>
  <<childname>><<= $cmonster ? lanSwitch(" snorts in displeasure.","不满地哼了一声。") : lanSwitch(" clacks their beak in displeasure.","不满地敲了敲喙。")>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<babyhawks>> follow behind you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<babyhawks>>跟在你的身后。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You keep circling from above, waiting for the perfect moment. You see it; your hunting instinct takes over, and you begin to dive.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你继续从高处盘旋，等待完美的时机。你看到它了，你的狩猎本能开始发挥作用，你开始俯冲。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<set _Double to 1200-maplebirch.get('BirdTower').party.length*50>>
<<dancedifficulty 300 _Double true>>
<<if $danceSuccess>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You move fast, <span class="green">fast enough to catch them before they recover.</span> The other lurker leaps up, trying to escape, but it is too slow. <<childname>> catches it in midair. You fly into the clouds, and your child follows you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      你的动作很快，<span class="green">足够在它们恢复前就抓住了它们。</span>另一只潜伏者跳了起来，想要逃跑，但它的动作太慢了。<<childname>>在半空抓住了它。你飞进了云层中，你的孩子也跟上了你。
  <</language>>
  <<flight_hunt_get "lurkers" 3>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <span class="red">But you are too slow.</span> The other lurkers leap up and intercept you. You veer off course and land on your side.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <span class="red">但是你太慢了。</span>其他的潜伏者跳起来拦截了你。你偏离了路径，侧身落地。
  <</language>>
  <<pain 3>><<gpain>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Before the lurkers can leap onto you, a screech cuts through the air. <<babyhawks>> dive into the midst of the lurker group, trying to catch prey in the chaos. You brush the dust off yourself and take off again. <<childname>> flies to your side, and <<childHe>> seems to have missed <<childhis>> prey as well.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      没等潜伏者跳到你身上，一声尖鸣划破了空气。<<babyhawks>>猛扑到潜伏者群当中，试图在混乱的局面里抓住猎物。你拍了拍身上的尘土，重新起飞。<<childname>>飞到你身边，<<childHe>>似乎也错失了<<childhis>>的猎物。
  <</language>>
  <<set _huntFail to 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<birdtower_hunt_companion_loot>>
<<babyhawk_hunt_return>>

:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Lurkers Lot Group []
<<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    Eager to prove your skill, you fix your eyes on the whole group of lurkers. To show that you want to strike first, you tilt to the side.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    想证明你的能力，你盯着整群潜伏者。为了表示你想先进攻，你向侧边倾斜。
<</language>>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').leaderTrait is "dominant">>
  <<childname>><<= $cmonster ? lanSwitch(" snorts in displeasure.","不满地哼了一声。") : lanSwitch(" clacks their beak in displeasure.","不满地敲了敲喙。")>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<babyhawks>> follow behind you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<babyhawks>>跟在你的身后。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You keep circling high above, waiting for the perfect moment. You see it; your hunting instinct takes over. You let out a shriek and begin to dive.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你继续在高处盘旋，等待完美的时机。你看到它了，你的狩猎本能开始发挥作用。你发出一声尖叫，然后开始俯冲。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<dancedifficulty 600 1200 true>><<tendingdifficulty 1 700 true>>
<<if $danceSuccess and $tendingSuccess>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <span class="green">In an instant, terror has nowhere left to hide.</span> Your shriek paralyzes the lurkers. You are fast enough to catch them before they recover. Your senses are sharper than ever. You grab a lurker in each hand, ready to return to the sky. But you spot another lurker within reach, and your body moves on its own; your feet come down right on it, and you catch that one too. <<childname>> snatches one in the air. You climb into the clouds and reunite with your child.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <span class="green">刹那间，恐怖无处遁形。</span>你的尖叫声让潜伏者们瘫痪。你速度极快，足以在它们恢复之前抓住它们。你的感官前所未有地敏锐。你两手各抓住一个潜伏者，准备重返天空。但你瞄到范围内的另一只潜伏者，身体自行移动，双脚直接踩上去，也抓到了它。<<childname>>在空中捕捉到一个。你升上云端，和你的孩子会合。
  <</language>>
  <<flight_hunt_get "lurkers" 4>>
  <<earnFeat "Feather Trick">>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <span class="red">But you are too slow.</span> The other lurkers leap up and intercept you. You veer off course and land on your side.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <span class="red">但是你太慢了。</span>其他的潜伏者跳起来拦截了你。你偏离了路径，侧身落地。
  <</language>>
  <<pain 3>><<gpain>>
  <br><br>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Before the lurkers can leap onto you, a screech cuts through the air. <<babyhawks>> dive into the midst of the lurker group, trying to catch prey in the chaos. You brush the dust off yourself and take off again. <<childname>> flies back to your side with empty talons, seeming to have missed <<childhis>> prey as well.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      没等潜伏者跳到你身上，一声尖鸣划破了空气。<<babyhawks>>猛扑到潜伏者群当中，试图在混乱的局面里抓住猎物。你拍了拍身上的尘土，重新起飞。<<childname>>空着爪子飞回你身边，似乎也错失了<<childhis>>的猎物。
  <</language>>
  <<set _huntFail to 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<birdtower_hunt_companion_loot>>
<<babyhawk_hunt_return>>

:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Lurkers Few []
<<effects>><<childSelect $BirdTower.hunt.leader>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    The lurker moves quite fast, darting between the bushes. You do not think you can catch it in flight.
    You could wait for it to stop and then ambush it, or chase it on the ground.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    潜伏者移动得相当快，在灌木丛之间穿梭。你不认为你能在飞行中抓住它。
    你可以等到它停下来再伏击它，或者是在地面上追击它。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').leaderTrait is "clever">>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<babyhawks>> wait, wanting to see what you will do.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<babyhawks>>等待着，想要看你会怎么做。
  <</language>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<babyhawks>> stare intently at the bushes, talons flexing lightly, eager and clearly itching to hunt this lurker.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<babyhawks>>紧盯着灌木丛的动静，爪子轻轻地虚握着，显得跃跃欲试，似乎迫不及待地想要捕猎这只潜伏者。
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<!-- 小鹰自己拿东西 -->
<<set _athlDiffMin to Math.max(0, $bird.hunts.weight - maplebirch.get('BirdTower').party.length) * 50>>
<<set _athlDiffMax to (_athlDiffMin + 500)>>
<<set $skulduggerydifficulty to 500>>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').leaderTrait isnot "clever">>
  <<lanLink ["Let your child hunt", "让你的孩子捕猎"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Lurkers Few PokemonGo">><</lanLink>>
  <br>
<</if>>
<<lanLink ["Ambush", "伏击"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Lurkers Few Ambush">><</lanLink>><<skulduggerydifficulty>>
<br>
<<lanLink ["Chase", "追赶"] "Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Lurkers Few Chase">><</lanLink>><<athleticsdifficulty _athlDiffMin _athlDiffMax>>
<br>
:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Lurkers Few PokemonGo []
<<switch $speech_attitude>>
  <<case "bratty">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        You point at the lurker on the ground and command your
      <<option 'CN'>>
        你指着地面上的潜伏者，指挥你的
    <</language>>
    <<= $cmonster ? lanSwitch("harpy chick","小哈比") : lanSwitch("hawk chick","小鹰")>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        . "I choose you, <<childname>>! Go!"
      <<option 'CN'>>
        。"就决定是你了，<<childname>>！去吧！"
    <</language>>
  <<case "meek">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Y-you can go if <<babyhawksyou>> want to try." You circle around <<babyhawks>>, encouraging <<babyhawksthem>>.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "你、<<babyhawksyou>>想试试的话就去吧。"你绕着<<babyhawks>>飞行，鼓励<<babyhawksthem>>。
    <</language>>
  <<case "neutral">>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        "Go on, <<babyhawksyou>>." You chuckle. "Show me what <<babyhawksyou>> can do."
      <<option 'CN'>>
        "<<babyhawksyou>>去吧。"你窃笑，"让我看看<<babyhawksyou>>的本事。"
    <</language>>
<</switch>>
<br><br>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<babyhawks>> let out a screech and dive down at the prey from high above. The lurker notices <<babyhawksthem>> at once and starts to flee.
    <br><br>
    It is agile and keeps changing direction, leaving the
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<babyhawks>>尖鸣一声，从高空向猎物俯冲而去。潜伏者立刻注意到了<<babyhawksthem>>，并且开始逃跑。
    <br><br>
    它的动作敏捷，反复改变移动的方向，把追逐在后面的
<</language>>
<<= $cmonster ? lanSwitch("harpy chick","小哈比") : lanSwitch("hawk chick","小鹰")>>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').party.length gt 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      s
    <<option 'CN'>>
      们
  <</language>>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    chasing behind it far behind.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    甩开一大截距离。
<</language>>
<<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').selectTrait("clumsy")>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <<childrenNames _tempIDs>> lose their balance in a sharp turn and crash face-first into the ground.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <<childrenNames _tempIDs>>在一个猛地急转弯之下失去平衡，脸着地撞向了地面。
  <</language>>
  <br>
<</if>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    <<babyhawksthem>> shriek and make one last lunge at the lurker, but it darts into a crevice and vanishes.
    <br><br>
    <<babyhawks>> return to your side with dejected calls. You soothe <<babyhawksthem>> for a while.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    <<babyhawksthem>>尖啸着，最后一次猛扑潜伏者，但它飞快钻入了一条缝隙，消失不见了。
    <br><br>
    <<babyhawks>>懊丧地低鸣，飞回了你的身边。你安抚了<<babyhawksthem>>好一会儿。
<</language>>
<br><br>
<<babyhawk_hunt_return>>

:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Lurkers Few Ambush []
<<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You wait for the lurker to settle down to rest, then land quietly. You memorize its position and sneak toward it carefully.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你等待潜伏者开始休息，悄悄着陆。你记住了它的位置，小心地溜过去。
<</language>>
<<skulduggerycheck>>
<<if $skulduggerysuccess is 1>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <span class="green">You manage to slip behind it.</span> While the lurker is unaware, you
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <span class="green">你成功溜到了它身后。</span>趁潜伏者浑然不觉时，你
  <</language>>
  <<if $farm_stage gte 10>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        toss your net over it. It struggles hard inside the net,
      <<option 'CN'>>
        把你的网扔向它。它在网中努力挣扎，
    <</language>>
  <<else>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        leap over and grab it. It struggles in your hands,
      <<option 'CN'>>
        跳过去抓住它。它在你的手中挣扎，
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      but soon gives up.
      <br><br>
      <<babyhawks>> land beside you, chirping, seemingly curious about your land-creature-like hunting method.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      但是很快就放弃了。
      <br><br>
      <<babyhawks>>降落在你的身边唧唧叫着，似乎对你类似于陆地生物的捕猎方法感到好奇。
  <</language>>
  <<if maplebirch.get('BirdTower').leaderTrait is "clever" and $farm_stage gte 10>>
    <<language>>
      <<option 'EN'>>
        <<childname>> curiously claws at your net, and you stop them just in time before they tear it.
      <<option 'CN'>>
        <<childname>>好奇地用爪子抓挠你的网，在抓破网兜前被你及时制止了。
    <</language>>
  <</if>>
  <br><br>
  <<flight_hunt_get "lurkers" 1>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      Just as you reach where it was, you <span class="red">come up empty</span>. It must have heard you and fled.
      <br><br>
      <<babyhawks>> land beside you, then run off in one direction. It seems <<babyhawksthem>> saw the lurker's escape route from above. You follow <<babyhawksthem>> and chase it all the way to a large crevice in the ground.
      <br>
      It seems the lurker escaped through here.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      就在你抵达它原先在的位置时，你<span class="red">扑了个空</span>。它肯定是听见你的动静逃跑了。
      <br><br>
      <<babyhawks>>降落在你的身边，随后向一个方向跑去。看起来<<babyhawksthem>>从上空看到了潜伏者的逃跑方向，你跟着<<babyhawksthem>>，一路追到了地面上的一处大缝隙。
      <br>
      看来潜伏者从这里逃走了。
  <</language>>
  <<set _huntFail to 1>>
<</if>>
<<babyhawk_hunt_return>>

:: Deadwood BirdTower Hunt Lurkers Few Chase []
<<effects>>
<<language>>
  <<option 'EN'>>
    You land near it and start running. The lurker notices you at once and starts to flee.
  <<option 'CN'>>
    你降落在它附近，开始奔跑。潜伏者立刻注意到了你，并且开始逃跑。
<</language>>
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <span class="green">You manage to keep up with it.</span> Soon the creature is within arm's reach. You jump on it and hold it fast. It struggles for a while, but soon gives up.
      <br><br>
      <<babyhawks>> land nearby, chirping happily for you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <span class="green">你设法跟上了它。</span>很快，这只生物就进入了你触手可及的范围内。你跳上并牢牢抓住了它。它挣扎了一会，但很快就放弃了。
      <br><br>
      <<babyhawks>>降落在一旁，为你高兴地叽喳叫着。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<flight_hunt_get "lurkers" 1>>
  <<babyhawk_hunt_return>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      <span class="red">The lurker is simply too fast.</span> It slips away faster still, and in no time you are left behind in frustration.
      <br><br>
      You return to <<babyhawks>>, and <<babyhawksthem>> chatter around you.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      <span class="red">潜伏者实在是太快了。</span>它溜得更快，不一会你就被懊丧地甩开。
      <br><br>
      你回到<<babyhawks>>身边，<<babyhawksthem>>围绕着你叽喳叫。
  <</language>>
  <br><br>
  <<set _huntFail to 1>>
  <<babyhawk_hunt_return>>
<</if>>
